ment","korean":true,"id":"Q429296","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q489543","name":"SeeYa","start":"2006","end":"2009"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/nam_gyuri/","x":"https://x.com/kyurin1022","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/3a26deb2-8710-49bb-ae36-df6741040656"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Nam Gyu-ri is a South Korean actress and singer. She was the leader of the Korean female trio SeeYa. In 2009, Nam Gyu-ri had a contract dispute with the group's management company and left the group. Nam has also acted, most notably in the film Death Bell and the drama 49 Days. On March 12, 2026, she participates in SeeYa's 20th debut anniversary reunion and restarts group activities after nearly 17 years.","title":"Nam Gyu-ri","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nam_Gyu-ri"}},"Q495069":{"id":"Q495069","name":"Han Seon-hwa","ko":"한선화","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Han Sun-hwa","Han Sun Hwa","Han Seonhwa","Han Seon Hwa","Hahn Sunhwa","Hahn Sun-hwa","Hahn Sun Hwa","Hahn Seonhwa"],"birth":"1990-10-06","death":"","birthplace":"Busan","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["pop singer","film actor","television actor","singer"],"debut":"2009","agencies":[{"name":"TS Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q491998","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q482995","name":"Secret","start":"2009","end":"2016"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/shh_daily/","x":"https://x.com/seonhwazzz","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4tPeRoHVwAjOwyLPOIGEmP","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/78ee3bc3-c296-4447-9ff4-3b4b60009817"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Han Sun-hwa, also known mononymously as Sunhwa, is a South Korean actress and singer. She is a former member of the South Korean girl group Secret. She made her television debut in 2004 while participating in SBS' Superstar Survival as a finalist, and in 2009, she was a regular cast member on a variety show called Invincible Youth. Aside from music,